        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Employees required to travel to a temporary work location on a common carrier will be compensated for hours of work and travel time to and from the temporary work assignment in accordance with the rulings of the Department of Labor, Wage and Hour Administrator. If premium pay is required under such rulings, then the provisions of Article III, Section E shall be followed. Whenever practicable, the travel schedule will be arranged so as to coincide with the employee's normal hours of work.",
